Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:38.97,main,Cthoni,0,0,0,,After I look at them, I'll take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.99,0:00:46.45,main,Cthoni,0,0,0,,Why in the world would he tell them that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.03,0:00:56.32,main,Bro,0,0,0,,Hey, Dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.32,0:00:59.66,main,Bro,0,0,0,,You can't go around glaring like that, \Neven at your enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.90,0:01:02.54,main,Bro,0,0,0,,You'll end up with wrinkles \Nwhen you grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.64,0:01:04.76,main,Bro,0,0,0,,I know that expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.76,0:01:10.56,main,Bro,0,0,0,,"How'd things end up like this \Nwhen we just went out to eat," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.19,0:01:13.56,main,Bro,0,0,0,,Think of it as a last-minute job, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.56,0:01:17.46,main,Bro,0,0,0,,Besides, you're the one \Nwho decided to jump into that hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.91,0:01:20.51,main,Bro,0,0,0,,You've been worried about Rudo, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.51,0:01:22.94,main,Bro,0,0,0,,Isn't that's why you tagged along?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.71,0:01:29.80,main,Bro,0,0,0,,Hey, sorry, sorry!\N Forgot you were sensitive about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.63,0:01:34.55,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,Cute dynamic you've got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.55,0:01:35.87,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,Is that there your kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.49,0:01:40.00,main,Bro,0,0,0,,Pretty much. Not by blood, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.34,0:01:43.87,main,Bro,0,0,0,,I'm hoping we can get out of here ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.37,0:01:48.63,main,Bro,0,0,0,,Dear'll start to get sleepy \Nif we're not back before nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:51.86,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,I see. So Dear's your name, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.56,0:01:55.89,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,Mind if I call you "Dear little boy"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.27,0:02:02.14,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,Guess that's a no? All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.14,0:02:06.08,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,He's at the age when \Na little brattiness is still cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:07.16,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,How old is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:09.78,main,Bro,0,0,0,,He turned ten last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.03,0:02:13.03,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,Hey, that's great. What day?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.03,0:02:14.60,main,Bro,0,0,0,,The 17th.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.60,0:02:16.12,main,Bro,0,0,0,,September 17th.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.12,0:02:19.45,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,Hey, close one! Mine's September 19th.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.66,0:02:23.22,main,Bro,0,0,0,,So you just got older, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.22,0:02:27.13,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,Don't say it that way. \NYou're making me feel ancient.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:34.88,main,Bro,0,0,0,,Listen to us. \NWe sound like old men chatting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:38.91,main,Bro,0,0,0,,Hey, don't laugh. It just makes me sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.26,0:02:41.25,main,Bro,0,0,0,,So, what's your story?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.25,0:02:44.19,main,Bro,0,0,0,,You don't seem particularly hostile.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.19,0:02:47.32,main,Bro,0,0,0,,Are you even here to fight us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.32,0:02:48.70,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,Bundus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.61,0:02:52.61,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,That's my name. You can call me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:55.86,main,Bro,0,0,0,,I'm Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.86,0:02:57.74,italics,Bro,0,0,0,,This is hard to navigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.47,0:03:00.00,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,As for my story...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.00,0:03:03.21,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,It's true that I'm not \Nfeeling hostile right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.77,0:03:09.88,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,I'm here on Zodyl's orders, but there's \Nother things I'm after, personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:14.14,main,Bro,0,0,0,,So if you can get those things, \Nwe can skip the fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.14,0:03:15.44,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.53,0:03:21.39,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,Beating you two would get me one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.11,0:03:43.04,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,What I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.31,0:03:44.80,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,is information.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.72,0:03:55.78,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,If you give me the info I want,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.78,0:04:00.39,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what happens if you lose to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.12,0:04:05.77,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,So tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.59,0:04:08.98,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,The boss of the Cleaners...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:11.47,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,Arkha Corvus...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.47,0:04:12.88,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.44,0:05:51.45,main,Semiu,0,0,0,,Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.92,0:05:58.42,main,Corvus,0,0,0,,You know I don't like that word.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:02.30,main,Semiu,0,0,0,,Never mind that! It's an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.56,0:06:05.42,main,Semiu,0,0,0,,Four members of Akuta, including Rudo, \Nand three members of Child
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.42,0:06:07.93,main,Semiu,0,0,0,,were taken away by the Raiders \Nand are currently missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.29,0:06:09.96,main,Semiu,0,0,0,,Gris told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.96,0:06:13.44,main,Semiu,0,0,0,,It seems the one with warp powers \Nfrom the report stole them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.44,0:06:16.18,main,Semiu,0,0,0,,Gris wants us to allocate \Npersonnel to look for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.44,0:06:21.66,main,Semiu,0,0,0,,Please, Boss! \NWhy won't you just wear your choker?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.66,0:06:24.38,main,Semiu,0,0,0,,It'd be so much easier if we \Ncould get in touch with you quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.06,0:06:32.62,main,Corvus,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.13,0:06:35.83,main,Corvus,0,0,0,,Semiu, round up anyone who's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.83,0:06:38.12,main,Corvus,0,0,0,,I'll figure out where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.02,0:06:42.54,main,Corvus,0,0,0,,I happen to know a great information broker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.65,0:07:01.95,main,Bro,0,0,0,,You want to know about our boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.46,0:07:05.53,main,Bro,0,0,0,,Bundus. What are you getting at here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.53,0:07:07.61,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,Just what it sounds like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.61,0:07:10.70,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,If it's too big a question, \NI can break it down for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:11.82,main,Bro,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.82,0:07:15.47,main,Bro,0,0,0,,You're trying to get important \Ninfo about the Cleaners
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:17.46,main,Bro,0,0,0,,by asking something unassuming, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.46,0:07:20.90,main,Bro,0,0,0,,I won't tell you anything that \Ncould put us at a disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.53,0:07:23.73,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,Don't get the wrong idea, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.73,0:07:26.22,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,I'm a strict individualist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.77,0:07:32.20,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,My questions stem purely from my \Nown curiosity and inquisitive nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.73,0:07:39.44,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,Nothing you tell me will get back \Nto the Raiders at large.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:42.86,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,It's a simple exchange of information \Nbetween you two and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.24,0:07:45.57,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,You can choose not to say anything \Nif you don't believe me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.57,0:07:48.25,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,but until you answer, \NI'll be staying where I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.25,0:07:49.99,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,and you'll be trapped here too...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.31,0:07:54.24,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,until bedtime comes around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.89,0:08:02.20,main,Bro,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.20,0:08:04.43,main,Bro,0,0,0,,But I'll only give the answers I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.15,0:08:08.51,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.86,0:08:12.16,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,What is Corvus's favorite food?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.50,0:08:19.98,main,Bro,0,0,0,,F-Favorite...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.98,0:08:27.04,main,Bro,0,0,0,,S-Sweet stuff, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:32.87,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,How old is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.21,0:08:36.87,main,Bro,0,0,0,,No one's ever... mentioned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.87,0:08:39.24,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,What does he do for fun when he goes out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:41.67,main,Bro,0,0,0,,I-I've never seen...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.67,0:08:43.83,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,How long has he been with the Cleaners?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.85,0:08:46.07,main,Bro,0,0,0,,I-I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.07,0:08:48.74,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen him \Nuse his vital instrument?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.74,0:08:50.53,main,Bro,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.88,0:08:52.57,italics,Bro,0,0,0,,Th-This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.57,0:08:57.51,italics,Bro,0,0,0,,I thought I could skip potentially \Ndamaging questions and wrap it up quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.51,0:09:02.23,italics,Bro,0,0,0,,but everything he's asking is totally \Nmundane stuff, so it's just getting weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.24,0:09:09.15,italics,Bro,0,0,0,,Dear's starting to get restless!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.75,0:09:14.91,italics,Bro,0,0,0,,I've got to do something, \Nor he'll grow up with wrinkles!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.87,0:09:20.43,italics,Bro,0,0,0,,So hard to navigate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.87,0:09:24.98,main,Bro,0,0,0,,I'm always between a rock and a hard place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.79,0:09:28.28,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,Fine, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.28,0:09:30.67,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,I see what you're trying to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.67,0:09:34.39,main,Bro,0,0,0,,Listen, man, I really don't know this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.53,0:09:38.57,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,I guess it's my turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.61,0:09:44.48,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,If your side loses, we're going to \Nserve you up to a trash beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.16,0:09:47.73,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,I don't know if you've seen this or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.14,0:09:52.95,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,but we Raiders have managed to \Nsuccessfully cultivate a few trash beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.66,0:10:11.13,main,Bro,0,0,0,,Dear. Are you hearing what I'm hearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.86,0:10:16.91,main,Bro,0,0,0,,Did he just give us incredible info \Nfor basically nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.81,0:10:19.20,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.20,0:10:24.47,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,The value of the information you gave me \Nwas indeed worthy of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:30.16,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,Despite being a mysterious figure, \NCorvus loves sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.16,0:10:33.21,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,All of a sudden, he feels human to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.21,0:10:36.16,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,I understand him very well now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.82,0:10:39.79,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,He hides his true self well,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.11,0:10:42.78,main,Bundus,0,0,0,,even from his own comrades!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.95,0:10:47.79,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,C'mon. No need to hide it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.29,0:10:52.28,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,You're just like me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.24,0:10:58.21,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,I've spent too much time going at it \Nwith people way stronger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.21,0:11:03.31,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Now average folks can't stomp me \Nunless I hold myself back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.30,0:11:10.62,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,When I'm going all-out fighting \Nand fighting and fighting and fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.62,0:11:14.67,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,but still can't win... \Nthat's when I feel most alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.35,0:11:21.41,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,And so... I can get my hopes up now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:26.14,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,You're someone besides the boss \Nwho can beat my ass in, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.17,0:11:33.84,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.68,0:11:42.97,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Zanka, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:44.96,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,No need to hide it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.96,0:11:47.69,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,You can let it all hang out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.69,0:11:51.32,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter who's a Cleaner \Nand who's a Raider...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.32,0:11:52.49,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Just show me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.49,0:11:54.11,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Show me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:57.44,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Show me the brutality you've been hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:12.23,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,I'm all out of ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.56,0:12:22.55,italics,Zodyl,0,0,0,,You can tell from the trash \Nthat falls from it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:25.87,italics,Zodyl,0,0,0,,that the Sphere is a place of abundance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:40.28,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,Living creatures are mysterious things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.97,0:12:47.16,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,They change their appearance \Nto adapt to their environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.87,0:12:50.04,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,Sometimes, the fallen trash brings
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:55.05,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,remains of species never seen on the Ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.76,0:12:57.56,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,Humans are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.92,0:13:02.87,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,The environments we live in will \Nresult in different kinds of humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.87,0:13:06.43,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,I'm a groundling. You're a Sphereite.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.98,0:13:08.93,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,Why, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.41,0:13:12.19,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,Why do we have the same look in our eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.43,0:13:25.87,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,Jabber told me that you and I smell the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.44,0:13:29.19,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,Whatever else he is, he's perceptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.19,0:13:31.78,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,That's what made me so interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.25,0:13:36.36,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,It made me want to meet you for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.78,0:13:40.05,main,Rudo,0,0,0,,Meet me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.64,0:13:42.47,main,Rudo,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:48.59,main,Rudo,0,0,0,,If you wanted me in on some weird, \Nhalf-baked plan to take down the Sphere,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.59,0:13:52.54,main,Rudo,0,0,0,,you could have come and \Ntalked to me like a normal person!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:57.20,main,Rudo,0,0,0,,B-Besides, I don't need \Nanyone talking me into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.20,0:14:02.70,main,Rudo,0,0,0,,I'm trying to get to the Sphere to punch \Nthose assholes because it's what {\i1}I{\i0} want!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.00,0:14:06.91,main,Rudo,0,0,0,,Don't pretend like we're the same \Nand drag the other Cleaners into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.67,0:14:16.78,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,I wonder. What is "normal"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.45,0:14:19.88,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,Rudo, did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.11,0:14:25.59,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,There are groundlings who see \Nthe trash falling from the Sphere
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.59,0:14:29.43,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,and worship it as "blessings from heaven."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:34.57,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,Even rotting food waste,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.57,0:14:38.36,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,even scrap lumber that \Ncrushes their flesh and bone...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.36,0:14:41.36,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,There are those who see it as a blessing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.36,0:14:42.86,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,and demand others do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.57,0:14:50.04,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,It may seem strange to outsiders,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:52.34,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,but when it's all you know, it seems normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.34,0:14:54.33,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,In time, it becomes "common sense,"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.89,0:14:57.08,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,and to fight against it becomes heresy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.26,0:15:07.12,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,"Common sense" can be beneficial.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.12,0:15:10.12,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,But a "common sense" designed by the corrupt
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.12,0:15:13.35,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,is a deadly poison to those \Nwho unknowingly imbibe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.02,0:15:19.90,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,You'll never know who has that poison \Nin their system unless it comes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.21,0:15:25.55,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,But there's a way to snap them \Ninstantly out of their toxic delusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.74,0:15:30.03,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,A shock to the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.11,0:15:48.34,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,These shocks are very useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.24,0:15:52.41,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,They draw someone's fundamental \Nnature to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.36,0:15:56.35,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,You've had that happen, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.35,0:15:58.85,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,With the shock Jabber dealt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.00,0:16:06.15,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,Oh, which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.07,0:16:09.91,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,The one Jabber is fighting right now
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.91,0:16:12.99,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,might also have something \Nto be drawn out from within.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.59,0:16:16.53,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,Or perhaps the shock will prove too intense...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.00,0:16:24.19,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,and he'll be crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.77,0:16:37.56,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.56,0:16:39.82,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,Here's another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.56,0:16:42.59,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,One of those "natural talents."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.07,0:16:47.22,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,No way a mediocrity like me can beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.22,0:16:49.69,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,"I wasn't going all-out," my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.69,0:16:52.14,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,"I was holding myself back," my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.11,0:16:57.78,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,I've seen plenty of people who said \Nthat crap 'cause they wanna look cool,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.78,0:17:02.71,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,but you can spot the real ones \Nby how clear-eyed they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.62,0:17:07.82,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,Man. It's the same shit anywhere you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.82,0:17:11.15,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,"A mediocrity can't beat a natural talent."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.14,0:17:18.10,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,But that's what makes \Nit so damn worth doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:22.10,sign_ArialBlack,Title,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,135)\shad0\bord0\fs8\fad(351,1)}Episode 16
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:22.10,sign_ArialBlack,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(323,220)\fs35\shad0\bord0\fad(351,1)\fsp4}Gifted and Not
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.87,0:17:50.01,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Hey, quit running!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.01,0:17:51.76,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Zanka, old pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.05,0:17:56.43,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Don't let this next one kill you, 'kay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.17,0:18:31.74,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Stormy Weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.90,0:19:19.68,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,All done now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.69,0:19:31.69,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Hey, look at you, fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.24,0:19:35.11,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,Not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.63,0:19:38.45,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,I'm not... finished yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:44.23,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,Until I prove myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.97,0:19:46.87,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,I'm not dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:07.21,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,You broke my rib! \NAnd then you punched me in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.06,0:20:09.82,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,You frickin' sadist!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.20,0:20:22.53,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,I knew you had more hidden away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.53,0:20:24.95,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Show me more of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.95,0:20:30.96,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,I don't do any of that "holding back" shit \Nyou were babbling on about!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.42,0:20:35.42,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,But don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.70,0:20:41.13,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Even a mediocrity like me \Ncan keep up with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.44,0:21:16.67,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Looks like you hit my left claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.16,0:21:23.43,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,When I'm in all-out mode, my left claws \Nhold three of my most recent toxins.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.23,0:21:26.59,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,There's the numbing toxin,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.59,0:21:29.47,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,a toxin for having a good old time,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.47,0:21:33.27,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,and the gloopy-goo toxin from just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.31,0:21:45.49,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,What, would you still rather be hit with shit?

